  "body": "## Summary\n\nTurns the root README into a polished portfolio-facing project showcase and replaces the old `Demo video — coming soon` placeholder with the real YouTube demo.\n\n### What changed\n\n- embeds a large clickable YouTube thumbnail for https://youtu.be/xaNDLMsuKKk\n- rewrites the project overview around the actual full-stack architecture\n- adds a concise capability matrix\n- expands the architecture and end-to-end workflow documentation\n- documents `VINTED_MODEL` vs `SEARCH_QUERY` targeting\n- documents persistent and adaptive multi-step negotiation behavior\n- surfaces dry-run / preflight / real-action guard and quota protections\n- documents scheduler concurrency, worker isolation and production defaults\n- adds Runtime dashboard / telemetry details\n- expands market-statistics and planning documentation\n- documents AES-256-GCM credential encryption and `FLIPBOT_ENCRYPTION_KEY`\n- fixes local setup instructions for the current port `8081` and the checked-in `flipbot_pr74` / Flyway-disabled configuration\n- links the detailed staged real-action testing guide\n- updates the roadmap now that the public demo video exists\n\n## Validation\n\n- compared against current `main`: README-only change\n- checked implementation against current backend / Playwright / frontend code and `REAL_ACTION_TESTING.md`\n- verified current stack versions from Maven and npm manifests\n- verified frontend API proxy and backend port are both `8081`\n\nNo application code is changed by this PR.",
